sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Student as 學生
  participant Page as 課程問答頁
  participant Controller as QaController
  participant Service as QaService
  participant Repository as SegmentRepository

  Student->>Page: 輸入問題並送出
  Page->>Controller: POST /api/v1/courses/{id}/questions
  Controller->>Service: ask(courseId, question)
  Service->>Repository: findByCourse(courseId)
  Repository-->>Service: Segment[]
  Service-->>Controller: Answer + citations
  Controller-->>Page: 200 response
  Page-->>Student: 顯示回答與來源
